*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% HPRT HM-A300 系列移动蓝牙标签打印机
*% 适用型号: HM-A300 / HM-A300E / HM-A300S / HM-T300
*% 协议: CPCL | 分辨率: 200 DPI | 纸宽: 80mm
*%

*FormatVersion:     "4.3"
*FileVersion:       "1.2"
*LanguageVersion:   English
*LanguageEncoding:  ISOLatin1
*PCFileName:        "HPRT_HM-A300-Series.ppd"

*Manufacturer:      "HPRT"
*Product:           "(HM-A300 Series)"
*ModelName:         "HPRT HM-A300 Series"
*ShortNickName:     "HPRT HM-A300 Series"
*NickName:          "HPRT HM-A300/A300E/T300 CPCL Bluetooth"
*PSVersion:         "(3010.000) 0"

*LanguageLevel:     "3"
*ColorDevice:       False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*Throughput:        "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer:      Type42

*% ── CUPS 过滤器 ─────────────────────────────────────────
*cupsVersion:       1.4
*cupsModelNumber:   0
*cupsManualCopies:  True
*cupsFilter:        "application/pdf 0 pdftocpcl"

*% ── 分辨率 ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*OpenUI *Resolution/分辨率: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 200dpi
*Resolution 200dpi/200 DPI: "<</HWResolution[200 200]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% ── 纸张尺寸 (物理尺寸 80mm x 各种高度) ─────────────────
*% 单位: PostScript 点 (1pt = 1/72 inch)
*% 80mm = 226.77pt  40mm = 113.39pt  50mm = 141.73pt
*% 60mm = 170.08pt  75mm = 212.60pt 100mm = 283.46pt
*% 120mm = 340.16pt 150mm = 425.20pt

*OpenUI *PageSize/纸张尺寸: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w227h284
*PageSize w227h142/80mm x 50mm:   "<</PageSize[227 142]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w227h170/80mm x 60mm:   "<</PageSize[227 170]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w227h213/80mm x 75mm:   "<</PageSize[227 213]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w227h284/80mm x 100mm:  "<</PageSize[227 284]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w227h340/80mm x 120mm:  "<</PageSize[227 340]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w227h425/80mm x 150mm:  "<</PageSize[227 425]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w227h567/80mm x 200mm:  "<</PageSize[227 567]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/纸张区域: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: w227h284
*PageRegion w227h142/80mm x 50mm:   "<</PageSize[227 142]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w227h170/80mm x 60mm:   "<</PageSize[227 170]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w227h213/80mm x 75mm:   "<</PageSize[227 213]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w227h284/80mm x 100mm:  "<</PageSize[227 284]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w227h340/80mm x 120mm:  "<</PageSize[227 340]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w227h425/80mm x 150mm:  "<</PageSize[227 425]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w227h567/80mm x 200mm:  "<</PageSize[227 567]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% ── 自定义纸张尺寸 ───────────────────────────────────────
*% CUPS 标准机制: 打印对话框会出现「自定义」尺寸，可直接输入宽/高。
*% 单位: 点 (1pt = 1/72 inch)。227pt = 80mm (机芯最大纸宽)
*%      36pt = 12.7mm  2268pt = 800mm
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width:        1 points 36 227
*ParamCustomPageSize Height:       2 points 36 2268
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset:  3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation:  5 int 0 0
*cupsMinSize: "36 36"
*cupsMaxSize: "227 2268"

*DefaultImageableArea: w227h284
*ImageableArea w227h142/80mm x 50mm:   "0 0 227 142"
*ImageableArea w227h170/80mm x 60mm:   "0 0 227 170"
*ImageableArea w227h213/80mm x 75mm:   "0 0 227 213"
*ImageableArea w227h284/80mm x 100mm:  "0 0 227 284"
*ImageableArea w227h340/80mm x 120mm:  "0 0 227 340"
*ImageableArea w227h425/80mm x 150mm:  "0 0 227 425"
*ImageableArea w227h567/80mm x 200mm:  "0 0 227 567"

*DefaultPaperDimension: w227h284
*PaperDimension w227h142/80mm x 50mm:   "227 142"
*PaperDimension w227h170/80mm x 60mm:   "227 170"
*PaperDimension w227h213/80mm x 75mm:   "227 213"
*PaperDimension w227h284/80mm x 100mm:  "227 284"
*PaperDimension w227h340/80mm x 120mm:  "227 340"
*PaperDimension w227h425/80mm x 150mm:  "227 425"
*PaperDimension w227h567/80mm x 200mm:  "227 567"

*% ── 输入槽 ───────────────────────────────────────────────
*OpenUI *InputSlot/进纸方式: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Roll
*InputSlot Roll/卷纸: ""
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*% ── 颜色模式 ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*OpenUI *ColorModel/颜色: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/灰度: "<</cupsColorSpace 0/cupsBitsPerColor 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% ── 设备 ID ─────────────────────────────────────────────
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:HPRT;MDL:HM-A300 Series;CMD:CPCL;CLS:PRINTER;"

